    "text": "By Claire Overton ,\n5 hours ago GREENFIELD, Mass. (WWLP) – The Greenfield community held a ribbon-cutting ceremony Wednesday for a new $27 million campus designed to serve residents experiencing homelessness throughout Franklin County. Operated by Clinical and Support Options, the facility replaces an outdated shelter with a comprehensive resource center and housing complex. The Clinical... Read full article",
